。从功能上来讲，爬虫一般分为数据采集，处理，储存三个部分。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"网络爬虫（又称为网页蜘蛛，网络机器人，在FOAF社区中间，更经常的称为网页追逐者），是一种按照一定的规则，自动地抓取万维网信息的程序或者脚本。从功能上来讲，爬虫一般分为数据采集，处理，储存三个部分。","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"a63ed134-237c-4b57-96b2-8ed9dc53dfac","name":"网络爬虫","color":"brown"},{"id":"6d8bed57-2dfe-4f91-af29-3c979861e620","name":"信息收集","color":"brown"},{"id":"abdea974-dc43-48be-b628-3642f38580c1","name":"python","color":"blue"},{"id":"25b1074b-a3fa-49f5-82cd-a37d85c5666f","name":"工具","color":"pink"}]},{"id":"1cd42f17-ccf0-4d97-9a41-c8577cb56549","rawId":"1cd42f17ccf04d979a41c8577cb56549","slug":"1cd42f17ccf04d979a41c8577cb56549","title":"Python语言进阶","date":"2023-12-20","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"Python语言进阶","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"Python语言进阶","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"abdea974-dc43-48be-b628-3642f38580c1","name":"python","color":"blue"},{"id":"27a34009-0a91-4fe3-bfd9-71ebd0b49330","name":"进阶","color":"brown"},{"id":"ea751af3-f527-46b7-8c67-e35299326f7c","name":"技术","color":"purple"}]},{"id":"dfabe6a4-81f4-49a6-b941-ca7b069d2e45","rawId":"dfabe6a481f449a6b941ca7b069d2e45","slug":"dfabe6a481f449a6b941ca7b069d2e45","title":"Linux操作系统大白（此处轻读）话","date":"2023-12-11","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"一篇文章搞懂linux方方面面","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"一篇文章搞懂linux方方面面","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"ta